ut $200 in winnings."}, {"start": 39.64, "end": 41.22, "text": " And it gets expensive."}, {"start": 41.82, "end": 45.66, "text": " We hold on to a stock that's collapsing, hoping to get back to our purchase price"}, {"start": 45.66, "end": 46.96, "text": " rather than accept the loss."}, {"start": 47.32, "end": 50.9, "text": " And we sell the winners too early for fear of losing the gain."}, {"start": 51.72, "end": 52.64, "text": " Retailers know it."}, {"start": 52.96, "end": 55.7, "text": " Only two left in stock offer ends tonight."}, {"start": 56.24, "end": 58.14, "text": " You're not buying to gain something."}, {"start": 58.14, "end": 60.3, "text": " You're buying so you don't lose it."}, {"start": 60.68, "end": 62.4, "text": " So how do you take back control?"}, {"start": 62.84, "end": 66.5, "text": " First, wait 24 hours before any purchase made under pressure."}, {"start": 66.94, "end": 70.96, "text": " Then ask yourself, if I didn't already own it, would I buy it today?"}, {"start": 71.74, "end": 74.3, "text": " Finally, set your rules in advance when you're calm."}, {"start": 74.8, "end": 76.74, "text": " Your budget and the price at which you sell."}, {"start": 77.64, "end": 78.18, "text": " Losing hurts."}, {"start": 78.7, "end": 79.3, "text": " That's human."}, {"start": 79.86, "end": 83.22, "text": " But a decision made to escape the pain isn't always the best one."}, {"start": 83.7, "end": 84.18, "text": " And you?"}, {"start": 84.62, "end": 86.92, "text": " Which loss has already pushed you into a bad decision?"}], "aligned_to_script": true}